transume (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add a Home page with direct access to backup, restore, cloning, images
    and activity, keeping application information on a separate About page.
  * Improve compact-window navigation and expandable workflow settings.
  * Warn about potentially insufficient backup space without rejecting
    used-block backups solely on the logical source-device size.
  * Refresh translations and regression coverage.

